==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 70~76.67 seconds<sup>2,100f~2,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The biggest threat in this stage is the Wicked Axe Cat, with an effective 700k HP if you don't bring [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]], although at this point it is very unlikely you have those units. Your best choices are units that can outrange him, and with heavy meatshielding, you will eventually brute force him and win.

